<title>USA: TAT Technologies Ltd Q3 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TAT Technologies Ltd Q3 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended,  Nine Months Ended,</p>
<p>				 September 30	 September 30,</p>
<p>			     1996	1995	 1996	  1995</p>
<p>  Revenues		4,006	3,715     12,543     12,198*</p>
<p>Gross Profit</p>
<p>   (before R &amp; D)	 956	1,226	3,381	 4,598</p>
